; An exception's phonemes. Cards pass through except words: a word's letters (1-27) go onto this machine's own pile
; (OUT at keep, back to INP at gw), counting n; at its end come -99, fn (1 a function word) and k (-100 - its
; number in the exception list, 0 for none). With k, the letters are dropped and out go the phonemes of that record
; of the exceptions' phonemes deck (OUT at ask; twelve cards to INP at gp: 10 x code + stress, then 0s), stress 0 in a
; function word, then -20. Without, the letters go on, then -14 for a function word, else -13.
;
; Address Contents Label Opcode Operand Comment
  03            rec     INP   x        03-19: a card: pass it on, a letter onto the pile, or a word's end
  04                    CLA   x
  05                    TAC   neg
  06                    SUB   c28
  07                    TAC   keep
  08            pass    OUT   x
  09                    JMP   rec
  10            neg     ADD   c99
  11                    TAC   pass
  12                    SUB   00
  13                    TAC   end
  14                    JMP   pass
  15            keep    OUT   x
  16                    CLA   n
  17                    ADD   00
  18                    STO   n
  19                    JMP   rec
  20            end     INP   fn       20-30: the word's letters on, or dropped
  21                    INP   k
  22            dr      CLA   n
  23                    SUB   00
  24                    TAC   fin
  25                    STO   n
  26            gw      INP   w
  27                    CLA   k
  28                    TAC   dr
  29                    OUT   w
  30                    JMP   dr
  31            fin     CLA   k        31-78: the end card, or the exception's phonemes
  32                    TAC   exc
  33                    JMP   fw
  34            exc     CLA   z
  35                    SUB   k
  36                    SUB   c100
  37                    STO   k
  38            ask     OUT   k
  39                    CLA   n11
  40                    STO   i
  41            gp      INP   p
  42                    CLA   p
  43                    SUB   00
  44                    TAC   nx
  45                    CLA   fn
  46                    SUB   00
  47                    TAC   po
  48                    CLA   p
  49                    SFT   01
  50                    SFT   10
  51                    STO   p
  52            po      OUT   p
  53            nx      CLA   i
  54                    SUB   00
  55                    STO   i
  56                    TAC   o20
  57                    JMP   gp
  58            o20     OUT   m20
  59                    JMP   rec
  60            fw      CLA   m13
  61                    SUB   fn
  62                    STO   x
  63                    OUT   x
  64                    JMP   rec
  65            x       DATA  0
  66            n       DATA  0
  67            fn      DATA  0
  68            k       DATA  0
  69            w       DATA  0
  70            p       DATA  0
  71            i       DATA  0
  72            z       DATA  0
  73            c99     DATA  99
  74            c100    DATA  100
  75            c28     DATA  28
  76            n11     DATA  11
  77            m13     DATA  -13
  78            m20     DATA  -20
